            </rdf:Seq>
         </dc:creator>
         <dc:subject>
            <rdf:Bag>
               <rdf:li>We expect grain and cotton prices to remain under pressureâ€¦</rdf:li>
               <rdf:li>â€¦ which could continue to limit the triggers for SLC.</rdf:li>
               <rdf:li>We would rather add exposure to the sector through 3tentos and Boa Safra,</rdf:li>
               <rdf:li>Sugar S-D remains tight, while near-term asymmetry to ethanol prices also looks positive.</rdf:li>
               <rdf:li>SÃ£o Martinho should benefit from the S&amp;E price backdrop, but Jallesâ€™ micro story makes it our preferred S&amp;E play.</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Bag>
         </dc:subject>
